### What's Under-Explored?

The recent campaign has heavily concentrated on:
- polymer_wt ~14–15.5, bath_temp 7–10, mixing_temp 38–45, pullcast_speed 5–8, coupon_to_bath_wait_time 150–300, nips_bath_wait_time 1500–1600

